urrent=\"true\" class=\"link\" aria-label=\"Earn 96% Bonus Miles with &quot;Almosafer&quot;\">Earn 96% Bonus Miles with \"Almosafer\"</a></span><!----></span></div><!----></nav></div></div><!----></div></app-jss-breadcrumbs><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-about-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"about-special-offer-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"about-offer-banner\"><h1 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Earn 96% Bonus Miles with \"Almosafer\"</h1><!----><h3 class=\"ng-star-inserted\"></h3><!----><div class=\"about-offer-banner-img\"><img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Alfursan/2026/09/AF---Almosaferdesktop-2400-x-440.ashx?h=440&amp;iar=0&amp;w=2400&amp;rev=ffba5abc709c47678c62445b74743b7a&amp;hash=9343716DF9CBBE0BB8877841FA15FFFD\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----></div></div><div class=\"about-offer-button\"><button mat-button=\"\" class=\"mat-focus-indicator button mat-button mat-button-base\"><span class=\"mat-button-wrapper\"><a href=\"https://apps.almosafer.com/69xl/d93q8iou\" linktype=\"external\" url=\"https://apps.almosafer.com/69xl/d93q8iou\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Book now</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined learn-more-icon\">call_made</span></a><!----></span><span matripple=\"\" class=\"mat-ripple mat-button-ripple\"></span><span class=\"mat-button-focus-overlay\"></span></button><div class=\"mobileExpireNote\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">event</span><span>Valid until 30 Sep 2026</span></div></div><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div id=\"page\" class=\"about-offer-content\"><div id=\"menuleftcontent\" class=\"menu-left-content\"><ul id=\"menu\"><li class=\"active ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">About the offer</span><!----><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined ng-star-inserted\">chevron_right</span><!----></a></li><!----><li class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><a><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\">Terms &amp; Conditions</span><!----><!----></a></li><!----><!----></ul></div><div class=\"right-content\"><span class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offer-rte\">\n<div id=\"#abouttheoffer\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h2>About the offer</h2>\n<span class=\"expire-note\"><span class=\"material-symbols-outlined\">event</span>Valid until\n30 Sep 2026</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<p><strong>Enjoy your upcoming stay with Bonus Miles in celebration of National Day, adding more value to every trip you book.</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Earn 96% Bonus Miles</strong> for every 2 SAR spent on your hotel booking with \"Almosafer\". Choose from a wide range of leading international and local hotels, with experiences to suit every need and preference.</p>\n<p>Make the most of your Miles and turn every stay into an exceptional journey filled with joyful moments and memories that last For Life.</p>\n</div>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3>Offer validity</h3>\n<p>Offer Period: 17–30 September</p>\n<p>Stay Period: 17 September –31 December</p>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div id=\"#termsandconditions\">\n<div class=\"section-heading\">\n<h3>Terms &amp; Conditions</h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"section-content\">\n<ul class=\"my-custom-list\">\n    <li>You can earn 96% more AlFursan Miles for every 2 SAR spent on domestic and local hotel bookings.</li>\n    <li>You must be a member of AlFursan Program with Saudia to earn Miles.</li>\n    <li>AlFursan Miles cannot be earned on bookings made using a voucher code or an automatically applied discount.</li>\n    <li>AlFursan Reward Miles cannot be earned in conjunction with other loyalty programs. Only one loyalty transaction is allowed per booking.</li>\n    <li>Miles will be credited to your account after you complete your stay and may take up to 14 days to be reflected in your account.</li>\n    <li>You will not earn Miles if you cancel your booking.</li>\n    <li>Almosafer reserves the right to modify or cancel this promotion, including its duration, at its sole discretion.</li>\n    <li>The offer is valid only on bookings that are paid for immediately.</li>\n    <li>There is no minimum spend or maximum value for this offer.</li>\n    <li>The offer is valid for logged-in users only.</li>\n    <li>Almosafer reserves the right to cancel bookings without prior notice if any misuse is identified.</li>\n    <li>For stays, Miles will be calculated based on the base price, excluding VAT, city tax and service fees, if applicable.</li>\n    <li>This offer is valid across all Almosafer KSA omnichannel touchpoints, including the website, app, call center, WhatsApp and retail branches.</li>\n    <li>This offer is not valid for travel agents or agencies.</li>\n    <li>The offer will be applied automatically when the customer selects AlFursan Reward Miles.</li>\n    <li>Terms and conditions specific to Almosafer apply.</li>\n    <li>Terms and conditions specific to AlFursan Program apply.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</span><!----></div></div></div></div></div><div></div></div></app-jss-about-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-special-offers class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"special-offers-wrapper similar-offers-wrapper\"><div class=\"main-content\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"section-wrapper\"><div class=\"special-offer-heading\"><h2 class=\"ng-star-inserted\">More offers for you</h2><!----><!----></div><!----><div class=\"offer-card-wrap ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div></div></div></app-jss-special-offers><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}